;
; How Talewind files a passage of a story graph, in MYRA (talewind_rules.h
; TR4): its story, its number in the story, its age rating (0 all ages to
; 4 adults only) and the bytes of its text.
^ZXTALE(story:i6, passage:i2) = rating:i1! ^ bytes:i4!
